// AWS EC2 Instances Terminated or Stopped  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1485, T1496
// Detects termination/stopping of EC2 instances (TerminateInstances/StopInstances). Bulk operations can indicate destruction or disruption;…
// False positives: Autoscaling and routine instance lifecycle management.
// Source: rules/impact/ec2-terminate-instances.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^TerminateInstances$/i or eventName=/^StopInstances$/i eventSource=/^ec2\.amazonaws\.com$/i
